cloud_mask (OmniCloudMask V4) third-party notices
================================================

The ONNX weights used by the cloud_mask model are a conversion of the OmniCloudMask V4
weights (two models, RegNetY-004 and EdgeNeXt-small U-Nets, averaged), made with
tools/models/convert_omnicloudmask.py. Upstream: https://github.com/DPIRD-DMA/OmniCloudMask
and https://huggingface.co/NickWright/OmniCloudMask (licence file: LICENSES.md).

Only the V4 weights (MIT) are used. The V1 weights are licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 and are not
used, converted or distributed by Atlas.

